{"id":"575c8521e7d1dd42","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-sharp-p-oracle-sat.md","title":"#P 与 #SAT oracle 的等价","display":"thm-sharp-p-oracle-sat — #P 与 #SAT oracle 的等价","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-sharp-p-oracle-sat","aliases":["28-thm-sharp-p-oracle-sat"],"display":"thm-sharp-p-oracle-sat — #P 与 #SAT oracle 的等价","depends_on":["[[28-thm-sharp-sat-complete]]","[[28-df-sharp-p-oracle]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; 346,352","source_printed_pages":"346,352","source_pdf_pages":"372,378","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"proof_status":"local-proof-reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-sharp-p-oracle-sat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-sharp-p-oracle-sat</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-sharp-p-oracle-sat — #P 与 #SAT oracle 的等价"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"533a7b5c79de3204\" href=\"?note=533a7b5c79de3204\" title=\"28-thm-sharp-sat-complete\">28-thm-sharp-sat-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ed85cd72838ef590\" href=\"?note=ed85cd72838ef590\" title=\"28-df-sharp-p-oracle\">28-df-sharp-p-oracle</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; 346,352"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"346,352"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"372,378"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local-proof-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P^{\\#\\mathbf P},\\mathbf P^g\">\\(\\mathbf P^{\\#\\mathbf P},\\mathbf P^g\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ed85cd72838ef590\" href=\"?note=ed85cd72838ef590\" title=\"28-df-sharp-p-oracle\">28-df-sharp-p-oracle</a> 的二进制函数oracle接口，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\#\\mathrm{SAT}\">\\(\\#\\mathrm{SAT}\\)</span> 及其完全性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"533a7b5c79de3204\" href=\"?note=533a7b5c79de3204\" title=\"28-thm-sharp-sat-complete\">28-thm-sharp-sat-complete</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P^{\\#\\mathbf P}=\\mathbf P^{\\#\\mathrm{SAT}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf P^{\\#\\mathbf P}=\\mathbf P^{\\#\\mathrm{SAT}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>因为#SAT属于#P，右侧包含于左侧。反向给定固定g∈#P，以保持计数归约R把每次g(q)查询替换为#SAT(R(q))查询，答案相同且长度、计算时间均多项式受界。原oracle机运行多项式步，所以复合仍为多项式时间。归约和多项式依赖固定的g，不要求对整个#P统一一个界。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition17.8、Theorem17.10与Theorem17.14的组合，印刷346、352 / PDF372、378。等价式是本地完整归约推导，补足Toda原子从书中#SAT版本转为类级版本的证明依赖。</p>\n<p>R6依赖证据复核：查询替换推导已复核，但#SAT完整完全性沿用受限Cook–Levin上游。本地推导记录保留；完整结论当前不作为已完成证明核验的依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-thm-sharp-sat-complete","status":"resolved","id":"533a7b5c79de3204","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-thm-sharp-sat-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-sharp-p-oracle","status":"resolved","id":"ed85cd72838ef590","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-sharp-p-oracle]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-sharp-p-oracle","status":"resolved","id":"ed85cd72838ef590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf P^{\\#\\mathbf P},\\mathbf P^g$ 使用 [[28-df-sharp-p-oracle]] 的二进制函数oracle接口，$\\#\\mathrm{SAT}$ 及其完全性见 [[28-thm-sharp-sat-complete]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-thm-sharp-sat-complete","status":"resolved","id":"533a7b5c79de3204","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf P^{\\#\\mathbf P},\\mathbf P^g$ 使用 [[28-df-sharp-p-oracle]] 的二进制函数oracle接口，$\\#\\mathrm{SAT}$ 及其完全性见 [[28-thm-sharp-sat-complete]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf P^{\\#\\mathbf P},\\mathbf P^g","display":false},{"tex":"\\#\\mathrm{SAT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf P^{\\#\\mathbf P}=\\mathbf P^{\\#\\mathrm{SAT}}.","display":true}],"bytes":1708,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-237","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"计数复杂性与隔离引理：[[28-df-sharp-sat]]、[[28-df-counting-reduction]]、[[28-thm-sharp-sat-complete]]、[[28-thm-sharp-p-oracle-sat]]、[[28-thm-hash-isolation]]。"},{"id":"d7ec083aeafd5af7","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\#\\mathrm{SAT}$ 与 $\\mathbf P^{\\#\\mathbf P}=\\mathbf P^{\\#\\mathrm{SAT}}$ 见 [[28-thm-sharp-p-oracle-sat]]。"}],"outgoing":["533a7b5c79de3204","ed85cd72838ef590"]}